# Ghost race finished, then RACE AGAIN against its ghost (w29r, Phase 9; pak flow, written with script_probe --text).
# Starts from the pak saves.press leaves (player AAAA): PLAYER 1 -> CONTROLLER PAK (DOWN x2) -> AAAA (SELECT MODE
# ~13 s) -> GHOST RACE (DOWN x2) -> SELECT TRACK (LAPS fixed at 3) -> car -> race (GET READY ~frame 690).
# Scene lever: the race's lap count is the byte 0x80152735 (3 in ghost and default races, 1 after LAPS 1 in
# SELECT TRACK; found by dump diff); the poke at 28 s (frame 840, after LAP 1/3 is shown) makes it a 1-lap race
# that gas alone finishes in time (gas-only 3-lap ghost races end DNF against the 3:40 limit).
# Frames: LAP 1/1 840, finish 3775 (AAAA 1ST PLACE TIME 1:38.858), BEST GHOSTS 3836 (AAAA enters the table: a
# 128-byte player-record write; NO ghost file is written to the pak, see w29r RESULTS), GAME OVER 4736, DOWN + A =
# RACE AGAIN (4860: the new race loads the in-memory ghost).
# Reaches func_800CC50C and func_800CC040 (BEST GHOSTS), func_800CBF2C and menu_back (RACE AGAIN, ghost load); the
# saves pak's player read at boot reaches func_800C7EC8, drone_set_catchup, draw_speedometer (SaveServer).
